            <div style="background: #3a1a1a; padding: 15px; border-radius: 4px; border-left: 4px solid #f44336; margin-bottom: 15px;">
                <p style="margin: 0; color: #ffae9e; font-size: 0.9em;">⚠️ <strong>WARNING:</strong> This action is <strong>PERMANENT</strong> and cannot be undone. All your data will be permanently deleted including:</p>
